# Audit Anchors

**Purpose:** Per-sprint retro-PR merge SHA chain. Producer:
`core/skills/ai-dlc/steps/retro.md` Step 5b. Consumer:
`core/skills/ai-dlc/steps/carry-over-evaluation.md` Step 1a +
`core/skills/ai-dlc/steps/gate-validation.md` Check 18.

**Schema.** One YAML document per sprint, separated by `---`. Each
entry:

```yaml
sprint: <N>           # integer sprint number
closed_at: <ISO-8601> # sprint-close timestamp
sha: <git-sha>        # retro-PR merge SHA on main; placeholder "PENDING" if PR not yet merged
notes: <optional>     # free-form one-liner
```

Entries are append-only. When the retro PR merges, lead edits the
placeholder `sha: PENDING` to the actual merge SHA in a follow-on
commit on `main`.

**Audit gate behavior.** `gate-validation.md` Check 18 resolves
`<prior_sprint_sha>` from the entry whose `sprint` field equals
`<current_sprint> - 1`. Missing entry OR `sha: PENDING` for the prior
sprint FAILS the gate CLOSED with explicit message. Silent skip is
forbidden.

